# Wave W17-Q (Route 120): ledger turf — long-rain grass: a cool blue-green sward under the permanent rain, darker wet flecks standing in it and pale rain-slick sheen flecks where the weather polishes it (design: calm speckled grass in long rain around a lake and a cliff; the Institute logs this route’s rain by the barrel). Route 120’s own ground — cooler and bluer than Route 119’s deep gorge green (which never dries but stays warm) and darker than Yamato’s rain turf: this grass is kept like a ledger, in columns of wet and sheen.
